Subject: Libretro dual: pair games, the 2P GBA may run a different ROM of the series
Series-Step: 18/19 (mgba_dual 1.6-os4)
Origin: hanbang (this project)
요약: 1.5 짝 게임 — 2P 게임기만 다른 판(예: 에그제 블루스 ↔ 컬로넬, 봄버맨 블루 ↔ 레드) 롬으로 켤 수 있게 함. 짝일 때만 상태 판 표시가 달라지고, 짝이 아니면 1.4.1 과 바이트까지 같음.

The two GBAs used to read one content ROM. The guest reads /tmp/hb_dual_p2rom (only with --connect and when the file
is at most 180 s old); the host gets the 2P ROM from the HBQ4 request (HBQ3 + 2P ROM CRC and path) and rebuilds the 2P
machine from it only if the CRC matches and differs from the 1P ROM. Plain .gba or a ZIP with exactly one .gba (stored
or deflate, zlib inflate shipped with mGBA, CRC re-checked). A pair state carries DUAL_STATE_PAIR15 and the 2P ROM CRC;
1.4.1 refuses it, 1.5 refuses a different pairing. A newly created 2P machine gets biosPrefetch 0xE129F000 when the state
would read 0 (found as a one-in-4500 rewind mismatch). Without a pair the behaviour and states are byte-identical to
1.4.1. Version string 1.5-os4.

